menu "AirBoat BMI270 diagnostics"

config AIRBOAT_IMU_DIAGNOSTIC_FAULT_TEST
    bool "Inject one bounded BMI270 read fault sequence"
    default n
    help
        For a temporary diagnostic build, replace five consecutive successful
        application-layer reads with ESP_FAIL five seconds after the first
        successful sensor read.
        The next real read resumes normal operation. This does not inject an
        I2C or BMI270 hardware fault.

endmenu
